OL,4,B'Laughing gas has ended careers' - so  
OL,5,Bhow common is it in football?          
OL,6,GIt is known as laughing gas but the    
OL,7,Gimpact nitrous oxide can have on a     
OL,8,Gprofessional footballer's body is      
OL,9,Ganything but funny.                    
OL,11,F"I'm not going to name names but I     
OL,12,Fhave colleagues who know Premier       
OL,13,FLeague footballers who are no longer   
OL,14,Fplaying as a direct result of nitrous  
OL,15,Foxide (use)," said Dr David Nicholl.   
